a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/855314-the-sundered-world?p=858224#post858224\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> No, that's a minor God of the Vinca, still above more common lower ranked Pangeans.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, it would seem pretty obvious the Thyrsus were probably the movers and shakers in that time and era.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T02:38:33-07:00","id":858241,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kumiko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/855314-the-sundered-world?p=858223#post858223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And that's a minor Pangean? Sweet Mary and Jesus. You better know the Spirit arcanum at 4-5 and likely Time and Space with her Ban to even think about negotiating with her let alone trying to kill her. Jeez.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Just a reminder that in order to directly affect a Pangaean, a mage needs Spirit + Life or Matter. Spirit alone will not be sufficient.<br /> <br /> Dark Eras, The Sundered World, p. 58,<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">Pangaeans are <span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Italic\"><i>not </i><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">spirits and are unaffected by<br /> anything that would affect a spirit only. One of the Wise<br /> who wishes to use magic on a Pangaean must use the<br /> Spirit <span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Italic\"><i>and </i><span style=\"font-family:GoudyOldStyleT-Regular\">either Life or Matter Arcana.</span></span></span></span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T06:17:00-07:00","id":858301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/855314-the-sundered-world?p=858241#post858241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Just a reminder that in order to directly affect a Pangaean, a mage needs Spirit + Life or Matter. Spirit alone will not be sufficient.<br /> <br /> Dark Eras, The Sundered World, p. 58,<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Because they are basically souped up Uratha? A blend of spirit and whatever? It sounds like some can be like Kami or Elemental at the base. Better be very careful when dealing with them and do your research.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2682-kumiko","name":"Kumiko","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2682_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-03T06:32:00-07:00","id":858304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kumiko</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/855314-the-sundered-world?p=858225#post858225\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly. It's the whole reason the Mysterium exists and and why they and the Free Council totally steal against each other anytime they have the chance. Think the Librarians against Raiders of the Lost Ark or Crystal Skull.</div> </div> </div> </div>This section is extremely interesting and fascinating, and it alone made me quite an happy guy for having backed the KS, although I'm also very pleased with To the Strongest. After reading it, I'm not really sure about the feasibility of magical time travel in 2e, but I keep having ideas and mental pictures about a party of Indiana Jones-style mage researchers doing time travel to the Neolithic Age (perhaps with Archmage assistance as part of an errand) to investigate th