rs/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T07:24:07-07:00","id":861816,"title":"","content":"Considering how I use the &quot;Red God&quot; as a epithet for Sutek, I was going to tie it down to Irem of the Pillars and the dreams the Unjudged dreams in his deathless sleep beneath the desert, his Will turns into the lost Mount Sinai as burning rage against the heavens... until Uluru was mentioned, and than that vision shifted toward the lost angel from the Pain Prophet's Testament who keeps his wrath and Curse away as long as the lullabies sang by the people of that land are kept being sang, protecting the stability of the world...<br /> <br /> And than I've thought &quot;Why not both?&quot; :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-08T08:24:21-07:00","id":861849,"title":"","content":"I thought that Red God was having something to do with cult of Red Word in Boston...","signature":"","edited":{